## Why This Is Asked

Contextualizes real-world constraints of scalable stores with per-instrument sharding and cross-region replication. Focuses on practical trade-offs rather than theory.

## Key Concepts

- Dynamic shard management and hot-spot mitigation
- Multi-region replication with consistency guarantees
- Live shard rebalancing with in-flight data handling
- Disaster recovery via PITR and WAL strategies

## Code Example

```javascript
function rebalance(oldShard, newShard){
  pauseWrites(oldShard);
  migrateData(oldShard, newShard);
  replayInFlight(oldShard, newShard);
  updateRouting(oldShard, newShard);
  resumeWrites(oldShard);
}
```

